  "prefLabel": "Plc 102.01 Advisory board",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 102.01 “Advisory board” means a board for a profession for which the practice act confers regulatory authority on the executive director in consultation with a board.\n\nSource. #12863, eff 9-4-19; ss by #13293, eff 11-24-21; ss by #13797, eff 10-26-23; ss by #14135, eff 12-1-24 (formerly Plc 202.02)",
